ABOUT VERDANT & CO.
We don't just plant gardens. We craft legacies.
Founded in 2010 by master horticulturist Elena Marsh, Verdant & Co. has grown into the Pacific Northwest's most celebrated landscape design studio. Our team of 28 specialists brings together artistry, ecology, and precision craftsmanship.
Every project begins with a conversation — about your vision, your lifestyle, your land. We listen deeply before we draw a single line.
	•	✦ Award-winning design recognized by the ASLA Pacific Northwest Chapter ✦ Sustainable, native plant-forward approach to every landscape ✦ Full-service from concept through maintenance — one relationship, one team ✦ Licensed, bonded, and insured with a 5-year craftsmanship guarantee

